(3982669, 566142, 78546, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!</td>', 'Great shot!!', '2007-08-08 23:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982674, 566236, 60701, '<td valign="top">I love the composition on this one.  I couldn''t figure it out at first but now that I look again, very cool.  Everything being off angle really makes you look closely at the photo and see the detail (and there is a lot).  Great job - my favorite to win.</td>', 'I love the composition on this one.  I couldn''t figure it out at first but now that I look again, very cool.  Everything being off angle really makes you look closely at the photo and see the detail (and there is a lot).  Great job - my favorite to win.', '2007-08-08 23:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982677, 566833, 60701, '<td valign="top">The purple haze is very strange, yet surprisingly effective.  Nice work.</td>', 'The purple haze is very strange, yet surprisingly effective.  Nice work.', '2007-08-08 23:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982680, 566455, 60701, '<td valign="top">Good idea, poor execution... Bland tones, funny textures, poor detail on the skeleton and not enough definition to the shadow on the wall.  What also would have been interesting would be to see a real person smoking and the skeleton as their shadow.  I realize the skeleton is small, but shadows are easy to change in size.</td>', 'Good idea, poor execution... Bland tones, funny textures, poor detail on the skeleton and not enough definition to the shadow on the wall.  What also would have been interesting would be to see a real person smoking and the skeleton as their shadow.  I realize the skeleton is small, but shadows are easy to change in size.', '2007-08-09 00:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982682, 566857, 60701, '<td valign="top">So simple and abstract...  I could see this on a wall in a museum.</td>', 'So simple and abstract...  I could see this on a wall in a museum.', '2007-08-09 00:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982689, 566809, 60701, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I like the sense of story I get from viewing this image.  I wish the colors were brighter though.</td>', 'Great idea.  I like the sense of story I get from viewing this image.  I wish the colors were brighter though.', '2007-08-09 00:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982696, 566648, 60701, '<td valign="top">They don''t look like they''re actually jumping off the dock.  My guess is that you''ll get hit for that.  But I do like how you chose to show action and keep a personal connection in a photo that barely shows any actual people, just feet.</td>', 'They don''t look like they''re actually jumping off the dock.  My guess is that you''ll get hit for that.  But I do like how you chose to show action and keep a personal connection in a photo that barely shows any actual people, just feet.', '2007-08-09 00:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982704, 566644, 60701, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to make of it... I get a sense that it might show something about this child''s character but I don''t know what that might be... title doesn''t help much either.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to make of it... I get a sense that it might show something about this child''s character but I don''t know what that might be... title doesn''t help much either.', '2007-08-09 00:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982709, 566884, 59754, '<td valign="top">Atypical, in a good way.</td>', 'Atypical, in a good way.', '2007-08-09 00:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982711, 566751, 59754, '<td valign="top">The processing of this photo bothers me- not because it''s abnormal, which is usually good in art, but because it adds too much ''business'' to an already busy photograph.</td>', 'The processing of this photo bothers me- not because it''s abnormal, which is usually good in art, but because it adds too much ''business'' to an already busy photograph.', '2007-08-09 00:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982738, 565906, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but the darkness in the lower left frame distracts me a bit. Maybe a different crop would have helped.</td>', 'I like this shot but the darkness in the lower left frame distracts me a bit. Maybe a different crop would have helped.', '2007-08-09 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982741, 566809, 48697, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nicely executed. I do think that if the cloths line could have been more level in the frame that it would be a bit more appealing, imo.</td>', 'Good idea and nicely executed. I do think that if the cloths line could have been more level in the frame that it would be a bit more appealing, imo.', '2007-08-09 00:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982744, 566871, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like the pic but do feel that the PP is a bit overdone for my taste.</td>', 'I like the pic but do feel that the PP is a bit overdone for my taste.', '2007-08-09 00:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3982747, 564357, 48697, '<td valign="top">Looks like it could be a bit sharper and I don''t see where the shadows play a key factor in this shot.</td>', 'Looks like it could be a bit sharper and I don''t see where the shadows play a key factor in this shot.', '2007-08-09 00:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
