(3987475, 566809, 27373, '<td valign="top">This is a clever idea, I am sure you will get quite a few comments on how this is a silhouette, rather than a shadow- my guess is 7- not including mine.  I probably would have used something other than what appears to be a pair of kiddie panties on the right and a pair of jeans on the left.  Maybe a pair of sexy undies on the right and a teddy on the left.  Telling more of a story, wife is getting ready for husband to return and is making sure things are "ready" he shows up sooner than expected.  You could''ve also done something using late afternoon son with the same poses, but without the sheet and the shadows spreading out across the ground.</td>', 'This is a clever idea, I am sure you will get quite a few comments on how this is a silhouette, rather than a shadow- my guess is 7- not including mine.  I probably would have used something other than what appears to be a pair of kiddie panties on the right and a pair of jeans on the left.  Maybe a pair of sexy undies on the right and a teddy on the left.  Telling more of a story, wife is getting ready for husband to return and is making sure things are "ready" he shows up sooner than expected.  You could''ve also done something using late afternoon son with the same poses, but without the sheet and the shadows spreading out across the ground.', '2007-08-10 18:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3987478, 566882, 27373, '<td valign="top">The focus could have been much better on this shot.  The pizza being bright and colorful pulls my eye immediatly to it and away from anything else in the photo.</td>', 'The focus could have been much better on this shot.  The pizza being bright and colorful pulls my eye immediatly to it and away from anything else in the photo.', '2007-08-10 18:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
