(3989282, 566315, 70036, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Borrowed theme, but we all do it. The harshness of the light on the sax distracts a bit.  Less contrast on the sax may have allowed this to be smoother.</td>', 'Great image.  Borrowed theme, but we all do it. The harshness of the light on the sax distracts a bit.  Less contrast on the sax may have allowed this to be smoother.', '2007-08-11 19:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989285, 566661, 70036, '<td valign="top">Good take on challenge.  Good composition.   Warm tones.</td>', 'Good take on challenge.  Good composition.   Warm tones.', '2007-08-11 19:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989287, 566142, 70036, '<td valign="top">Seems to need some contrast, color or something.   The shadows could be more distinct.</td>', 'Seems to need some contrast, color or something.   The shadows could be more distinct.', '2007-08-11 19:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989292, 566455, 70036, '<td valign="top">The focus of this image is more on the skeleton than on the shadow.  The focus is really the cigar.  Perhaps toning down the white of the skeleton and deepening the shadow would draw one''s attention better.  The smoke within the shadow is good.</td>', 'The focus of this image is more on the skeleton than on the shadow.  The focus is really the cigar.  Perhaps toning down the white of the skeleton and deepening the shadow would draw one''s attention better.  The smoke within the shadow is good.', '2007-08-11 19:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989295, 566548, 70036, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Wrong challenge?   The title does help.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Wrong challenge?   The title does help.', '2007-08-11 19:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989299, 565625, 70036, '<td valign="top">The shadow does appear a bit secondary to the image, but does look ''a part'' of you.</td>', 'The shadow does appear a bit secondary to the image, but does look ''a part'' of you.', '2007-08-11 19:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989304, 566231, 70036, '<td valign="top">I like it very much.   I had considered this type of composition for my entry.  Great tone without losing highlights or shadows.  Would like to see more images like this at DPC.</td>', 'I like it very much.   I had considered this type of composition for my entry.  Great tone without losing highlights or shadows.  Would like to see more images like this at DPC.', '2007-08-11 19:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989307, 566871, 70036, '<td valign="top">Grainy.</td>', 'Grainy.', '2007-08-11 19:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989310, 566873, 70036, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Great control over dynamic range.  Powerful use of shadows for your design elements.   Great retention of detail in the grain of the wood.  (tone mapped?).</td>', 'Excellent.  Great control over dynamic range.  Powerful use of shadows for your design elements.   Great retention of detail in the grain of the wood.  (tone mapped?).', '2007-08-11 19:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989319, 566236, 70036, '<td valign="top">OK, first review was - huh? shadows?  Why a girl falling in between sky scrapers?  Portrait does not work for me, I guess.     Landscape: it is fabulous.  Now am I looking at shadows - I think.  It is a great photo regardless.    I will now turn my monitor back to the correct orientation and continue voting.</td>', 'OK, first review was - huh? shadows?  Why a girl falling in between sky scrapers?  Portrait does not work for me, I guess.     Landscape: it is fabulous.  Now am I looking at shadows - I think.  It is a great photo regardless.    I will now turn my monitor back to the correct orientation and continue voting.', '2007-08-11 19:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989321, 566598, 70036, '<td valign="top">Too bad we cannot see the forks more clearly to see how dramatic the reflections are compared to the forks.  Especially the black fork, since it blends into its shadow.</td>', 'Too bad we cannot see the forks more clearly to see how dramatic the reflections are compared to the forks.  Especially the black fork, since it blends into its shadow.', '2007-08-11 19:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989322, 566819, 70036, '<td valign="top">Simple.  Straight to the point.</td>', 'Simple.  Straight to the point.', '2007-08-11 19:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989324, 566307, 70036, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2007-08-11 19:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989327, 566529, 70036, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  It is almost as if the shadows on the left edge are not necessary.  Probably could be a more powerful image without them.   But excellent as is.</td>', 'Excellent.  It is almost as if the shadows on the left edge are not necessary.  Probably could be a more powerful image without them.   But excellent as is.', '2007-08-11 19:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989332, 566660, 70036, '<td valign="top">Good composition.   The rule of straightness would have helped this. If the vertical line was more on the the thirds line it could be stronger.  I would not have cared if you had not put that in your title.  Now I expect it to really be on the thirds.....   Nice job.</td>', 'Good composition.   The rule of straightness would have helped this. If the vertical line was more on the the thirds line it could be stronger.  I would not have cared if you had not put that in your title.  Now I expect it to really be on the thirds.....   Nice job.', '2007-08-11 19:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989334, 566743, 70036, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2007-08-11 19:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989336, 566070, 70036, '<td valign="top">Nice,  But shadows as the focus.....?</td>', 'Nice,  But shadows as the focus.....?', '2007-08-11 19:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989338, 566673, 70036, '<td valign="top">Actually your own silhouette.</td>', 'Actually your own silhouette.', '2007-08-11 19:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989344, 564357, 70036, '<td valign="top">A little lack of focus/sharpness?   Shadow are not the real focus.  Wonderful composition.</td>', 'A little lack of focus/sharpness?   Shadow are not the real focus.  Wonderful composition.', '2007-08-11 19:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989347, 566624, 70036, '<td valign="top">Clear, to the point. Simple.  I like it.</td>', 'Clear, to the point. Simple.  I like it.', '2007-08-11 19:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989350, 566763, 70036, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo.</td>', 'Wonderful photo.', '2007-08-11 19:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3989417, 566513, 75192, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the shot of the legs and shadows, but i feel that the depth of field ruins it slightly.</td>', 'I love the idea and the shot of the legs and shadows, but i feel that the depth of field ruins it slightly.', '2007-08-11 20:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
