(3990068, 565800, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution.  I like how he''s casually reading and not expecting anything.  Good job on the B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'Great idea and execution.  I like how he''s casually reading and not expecting anything.  Good job on the B&W conversion.', '2007-08-12 03:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3990076, 565370, 42495, '<td valign="top">On a technical level, this is well done, with the exception that the two models are at different levels.  But it doesn''t matter much.  What comes through is the raw emotion associated with this scene and the feeling experienced by way too many children.  Parents should help their children develop self esteem and not make them sink into the ground.<br/> <br/>My score is high enough to possibly win a ribbon, but I hope yours gets the blue. 10</td>', 'On a technical level, this is well done, with the exception that the two models are at different levels.  But it doesn''t matter much.  What comes through is the raw emotion associated with this scene and the feeling experienced by way too many children.  Parents should help their children develop self esteem and not make them sink into the ground. My score is high enough to possibly win a ribbon, but I hope yours gets the blue. 10', '2007-08-12 04:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3990101, 566802, 70103, '<td valign="top">Nice clouds and details in the ripples, I would''ve liked it better if some details could be made out of the rocks</td>', 'Nice clouds and details in the ripples, I would''ve liked it better if some details could be made out of the rocks', '2007-08-12 04:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
