(3991706, 566585, 74371, '<td valign="top">First, I have to apologize. I didn''t stop and really look at this photo. I must have been tired cause all I saw were glasses and no shadows. Now...I can see that what I saw were the shadows... kinda like all that is between my ears....nothing but darkness.<br/> <br/>Great shot!!  Way to go!!!</td>', 'First, I have to apologize. I didn''t stop and really look at this photo. I must have been tired cause all I saw were glasses and no shadows. Now...I can see that what I saw were the shadows... kinda like all that is between my ears....nothing but darkness. Great shot!!  Way to go!!!', '2007-08-13 01:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
