(3995299, 566378, 66597, '<td valign="top">Most interesting, Don. I really like the OOF nature. Gives the emotive of a blind boy searching. I''ve been impressed with your work lately.</td>', 'Most interesting, Don. I really like the OOF nature. Gives the emotive of a blind boy searching. I''ve been impressed with your work lately.', '2007-08-13 22:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3995306, 566876, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t score considerably higher. I think there may be too much negative space between you and Amelia, but then again, it also gives a spacial sense of distance, so I''m torn on that. I do like the grain a lot. The only thing that bothers me here is that the shadow seems more like an aside than the reason for the photo. Nonetheless, I find this an artistic and quite poignant piece. Excellent work.</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t score considerably higher. I think there may be too much negative space between you and Amelia, but then again, it also gives a spacial sense of distance, so I''m torn on that. I do like the grain a lot. The only thing that bothers me here is that the shadow seems more like an aside than the reason for the photo. Nonetheless, I find this an artistic and quite poignant piece. Excellent work.', '2007-08-13 22:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3995308, 565370, 68178, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture! And a good reminder for a new dad.</td>', 'Very cool picture! And a good reminder for a new dad.', '2007-08-13 22:13:51.000000', NULL, 0),
