(3996832, 566378, 24454, '<td valign="top">FANtastic!   There seems to be a scary story in this photo.  I love the mystery of it.   It wouldn''t be nearly as effective if it was a grown person.  The child gives it such a great feel of wanting to make sure he is okay :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'FANtastic!   There seems to be a scary story in this photo.  I love the mystery of it.   It wouldn''t be nearly as effective if it was a grown person.  The child gives it such a great feel of wanting to make sure he is okay :) ', '2007-08-14 12:23:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3996844, 566880, 44877, '<td valign="top">I thought this was so exquisite and assumed it would not do well. I gave you the 10 because I like the image a lot and think it''s very inspired and emotive. I also gave you the 10 because I figured this photo is so un-dpc-esque that you be voted down for doing something out of the box. I like to encourage out of the box behavior. :o)</td>', 'I thought this was so exquisite and assumed it would not do well. I gave you the 10 because I like the image a lot and think it''s very inspired and emotive. I also gave you the 10 because I figured this photo is so un-dpc-esque that you be voted down for doing something out of the box. I like to encourage out of the box behavior. :o)', '2007-08-14 12:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3996894, 566562, 52945, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I had to use Google to translate the title. I really like the lighting. I think the shot would have more impact if the shadow hands were much closer to her, preferably touching her arm. As it is, the lighting (and from how her shadow is falling) suggest that he is still a distance away. The fan is a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice shot. I had to use Google to translate the title. I really like the lighting. I think the shot would have more impact if the shadow hands were much closer to her, preferably touching her arm. As it is, the lighting (and from how her shadow is falling) suggest that he is still a distance away. The fan is a nice touch.', '2007-08-14 12:49:35.000000', NULL, 0),
